[{"title":"春日白门写怀","author":"谢晋","text":"兴尽春衣过却寒，经旬不放酒杯乾。\n莺娇故况翻多语，花恼吟情艳未残。\n白雪词成人共接，红笺书就妓偷看。\n便拚老我京华客，烂醉狂歌且尽欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6704,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋庭雨窗","author":"谢晋","text":"纷纷黄叶下庭柯，夜永阴寒袭幔罗。\n灯影尚怜诗骨瘦，雨声偏向客窗多。\n乡关有梦何时到，亲友无书半载过。\n坐久忽惊檐溜断，鸣蛩四壁助吟哦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6705,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题熊大使梦萱诗卷","author":"谢晋","text":"官舍思亲久，庭喧入梦频。\n长随花里蝶，绕遍砌前春。\n开落虽成幻，栽培自感神。\n芳馨忽吹散，不觉一沾巾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6706,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中登甘露寺","author":"谢晋","text":"多景楼前兴趣清，试凭高处散羁情。\n香台远映金山寺，烟树斜连铁瓮城。\n帆带雨飞来更疾，鸥随潮落去还轻。\n却怜南北经过客，谁肯停桡向此行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6707,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客感醉中偶成","author":"谢晋","text":"旅馆夜沉沉，挑灯坐独吟。\n不缘愁易醉，那觉酒杯深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题滕王阁图","author":"谢晋","text":"巍巍高阁瞰清波，阑外时闻响佩珂。\n蛱蝶图成人已去，朱帘不捲雨来多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送顾掾秩满之京","author":"谢晋","text":"罢阅案间牍，复辞江上家。\n千山迎白下，一骑入京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"苍松影静白云闲，路转深溪第几湾。\n好是雨晴秋色里，杖藜随处看青山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晴雪轩为李文翰赋","author":"谢晋","text":"同云初散见晴空，四面轩开一色中。\n光射庭除骄夜月，寒侵涧户薄春风。\n不妨待伴长堆积，还惜当阳渐化融。\n好向尊前歌白苧，与君沈醉乐年丰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"脩竹坞访萧隐士","author":"谢晋","text":"草堂寂寞西涧坳，隔林犬吠声寥寥。\n幽人无事不出户，送客有时还过桥。\n溪上斜阳立将尽，莎间细路归仍遥。\n明朝秋风桂花发，卧稳东山谁见招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送医学盛启东之京","author":"谢晋","text":"欲试轩岐学，相将上九天。\n祖陈枫叶下，席展杏林边。\n暂别烧丹灶，来登罨画船。\n衣冠颁日赐，雨露想承偏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"除夕","author":"谢晋","text":"客邸逢除夕，惊看历又终。\n春回鸡唱里，寒尽漏声中。\n畏老愁添岁，安贫懒送穷。\n围炉倾柏酒，烧烛待东风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立春日喜甥陆懋至","author":"谢晋","text":"客边寒已尽，喜汝共春来。\n况有乡园信，能无怀抱开。\n辛盘初试菜，午馔更添杯。\n念我本多寂，匆匆莫便回。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送季冬科举","author":"谢晋","text":"中吴贤季札，射策去长安。\n路自云边入，花从马上看。\n露分丹桂湿，风飐绿袍宽。\n会待泥金帖，亲闱报捷欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人村赵九皋","author":"谢晋","text":"忆昔交游日，垂髫即共师。\n年来俱老大，君更美丰姿。\n多病难为别，相贻独有诗。\n天官名著久，行旆莫迟迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题汤隐君小林居","author":"谢晋","text":"旧业依东郭，林园仅亩馀。\n日来无俗辙，岁久似僧居。\n不购邻边地，惟添架上书。\n何时分半榻，清话夜窗虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"顾孝子林塘佳趣","author":"谢晋","text":"甫里幽栖处，龟蒙旧宅边。\n闲居惟奉母，高遁在希贤。\n林麓通樵径，坡塘隐钓船。\n冰澌鱼跃锦，苔迸笋穿钱。\n甘旨慈颜悦，春风綵袖翩。\n吾将乞萱草，分树北堂前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题松涧寒鸦图","author":"谢晋","text":"松柏枯欲拆，日色澹无辉。\n双鹤高翔去，寒鸦作阵飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送前太守徐二丈之京","author":"谢晋","text":"出守名邦两任间，退居田里二毛颁。\n更之官去非为老，乞得身归便是闲。\n兰棹又辞湖畔宅，蒲轮渐远寺前山。\n汉庭肯遂中公志，冠带应教致仕还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客至","author":"谢晋","text":"黄叶纷纷拥砌苔，柴扉寂寂面峰开。\n庭间忽闻两鸦噪，门外不速三人来。\n烹葵致敬聊为饷，短日频移且莫催。\n知我幽居无别事，不妨闲坐更徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题高尚书彦敬画竹","author":"谢晋","text":"烟稍渐长拂云端，露叶高垂不可攀。\n遗墨未乾人去远，独留清节在人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈公济山居五咏 其一 白石坡","author":"谢晋","text":"缘浮入山处，有石平如砥。\n风雨长苔痕，还从风雨洗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈公济山居五咏 其二 清阴谷","author":"谢晋","text":"幽谷夏已深，槐柳阴初合。\n清昼落花风，禽声自相荅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈公济山居五咏 其三 山斋","author":"谢晋","text":"山客经旬出，林花日将谢。\n风吹涧户开，麋鹿眠床下。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈公济山居五咏 其四 野亭","author":"谢晋","text":"缉茅春墅中，日夕乱峰绕。\n昨夜杏开花，春风吹碧草。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题沈公济山居五咏 其五 竹涧","author":"谢晋","text":"竹绕石泉生，泉流竹根出。\n涧底有新梢，山中知夏日。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其一 清镜阁","author":"谢晋","text":"平湖澄碧鉴，虚阁瞰清波。\n有月心同赏，无风水自磨。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其二 楞伽室","author":"谢晋","text":"楞伽千载室，兰若一函经。\n为问看经者，年来几百龄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其三 青莲峰","author":"谢晋","text":"影向湖波落，青临梵宇开。\n上人趺坐日，高处作层台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6732,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其四 白云径","author":"谢晋","text":"一径萝霏杂，冥冥埽不开。\n空中闻锡响，知是有僧来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6733,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其五 双冷泉","author":"谢晋","text":"碧甃寒相对，潆渟西复东。\n不缘居一地，那得两心空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6734,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其六 翠微亭","author":"谢晋","text":"石径穿云去，山亭傍路安。\n坐来清润积，吟袂欲生寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6735,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其七 先月楼","author":"谢晋","text":"层楼面沧海，月出预能期。\n想是凭阑处，人间未见时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6736,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题宝积寺八咏 其八 玩古轩","author":"谢晋","text":"欲识古人趣，当玩古人心。\n古人既自得，视古犹视今。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6737,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其一 楞伽院","author":"谢晋","text":"楞伽开净域，闻自道林兴。\n山水清佳处，由来半属僧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6738,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其二 南池","author":"谢晋","text":"平池澄晓鉴，虚阁涵秋月。\n时有炼形人，闲来照须发。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6739,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其三 石室","author":"谢晋","text":"寒逼禅僧定，凉醒醉客眠。\n户枢从不蠹，岁月任推迁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6740,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其四 八隔泉池","author":"谢晋","text":"凿石破苍苔，青天地底来。\n夜深寒月印，疑是晓奁开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6741,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其五 石门","author":"谢晋","text":"峭壁拥双扉，亭亭夹翠微。\n山灵虽解设，不禁白云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6742,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其六 寒泉","author":"谢晋","text":"空壑积阴晦，层崖冱冰雪。\n下有清冷泉，终年流不歇。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6743,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其七 马迹石","author":"谢晋","text":"追风归似铁，留迹向山深。\n神力犹诃护，苔痕不敢侵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6744,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其八 南峰","author":"谢晋","text":"日出众山窅，月落众山黑。\n朝来捲幔看，气势凌秋色。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6745,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其九 待月岭","author":"谢晋","text":"诗人一壶酒，待月升东岭。\n松壑起涛声，山风吹上影。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6746,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十 碧淋泉","author":"谢晋","text":"涓涓清涧中，长洗山僧钵。\n还将钵盛去，泻向玻瓶滑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6747,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十一 放鹤亭","author":"谢晋","text":"久养笼中鹤，如何却放归。\n不知初放日，曾别主人非。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6748,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"支硎山十二咏 其十二 牛头峰","author":"谢晋","text":"头角昂藏出，经春卧夕曛。\n无人来问喘，嘘气自成云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6749,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日过陈孟敷书馆写画诗","author":"谢晋","text":"廛居城北苦湫隘，况复维时当九夏。\n黄埃飞扬盈坐隅，南薰不到庭轩下。\n清晨远策偶寻幽，来访陈蕃读书舍。\n竹树萧森风满林，图史纷纭签绕架。\n窗前研具颇幽洁，侍右童生亦闲雅。\n烹茶扫榻固相延，拂拭溪藤需小画。\n嗟余尘垢久填臆，欲写溪山未能暇。\n对此襟怀始觉清，何吝当轩恣挥洒。\n含豪濡墨起云烟，千岩万壑生虚籁。\n一幅都无半日成，持向高堂便宜挂。\n君家舅氏严昌翁，偶来见之忽惊差。\n贤甥珍重即相惠，邀我题诗继三榭。\n坐久吟成兴欲阑，林稍远见斜阳下。\n明朝有意更来寻，仍与君家了清债。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6750,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"画天池石壁图送马谷中还金陵","author":"谢晋","text":"中吴之山何壮哉，群峰拥翠西南来。\n就中天池秀莫比，灵境迥出如天台。\n石林青苍蔽晴昼，草碧花香春雨后。\n莲峰倒影落寒波，松籁翻声作金奏。\n兰若去空不盈尺，山僧住久甘岑寂。\n云中犬吠有人来，烟外钟鸣知日夕。\n忆昔携君行乐时，浴沂风味相追随。\n流觞共藉池边草，瀹茗还题石上诗。\n怜君别去金陵路，嗟我穷年守芸蠹。\n每怀清景只依然，常恐朱颜不如故。\n今年君随春共还，访我来需画里山。\n阴崖石壁才隐起，但见云雾飞窗间。\n明朝持向金陵去，故山移入斋居内。\n吟馀时复一披图，应念当年共游处。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6751,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送圆鉴中住杭城海会寺","author":"谢晋","text":"罢纂金仙贝叶编，囊衣又上浙江船。\n吴山树色春城里，萧寺钟声暮雨边。\n智永终期追草圣，贯休不独悟诗禅。\n遥知入院谭经暇，试茗还烹第一泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6752,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送观上人","author":"谢晋","text":"路转长干入翠微，寻幽常与道人期。\n政忻接席听谈讲，又见停桡话别离。\n上苑莺花留住久，故山猿鹤怨归迟。\n却怜今夜禅窗月，更约同看定几时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6753,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送宗季传住槜李真如寺","author":"谢晋","text":"加禾南下旧招提，唐相裴休故宅居。\n近喜吾师开讲席，正逢宾馆罢脩书。\n闲挥尘拂天花洒，静对鸳湖夜月虚。\n别去停云如有念，新缄毋吝寄双鱼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6754,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送汇木庵上人","author":"谢晋","text":"琅函脩罢便治装，笑指东吴是故乡。\n瓶水贮来和涧月，囊衣披去带天香。\n雨新苔石跏趺静，风满襟怀啸咏凉。\n归到山中犹夏日，枇杷果熟待师尝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6755,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送钊上人","author":"谢晋","text":"鹁鸠啼断树阴阴，官寺俄逢夏已临。\n晓润行装梅雨细，寒惊乡梦麦秋深。\n穿云还认来时路，见月应悬别去心。\n安得如师归旧里，孤琴携上翠微寻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6756,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴僧游杭","author":"谢晋","text":"随例编摩寄此身，思家梦绕太湖滨。\n山中坐腊辜长夏，客里清斋过尽春。\n杖锡未游天竺寺，袈裟先带玉京尘。\n明朝试屐孤山路，应访梅花树底人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6757,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题谟上人碧梧山房","author":"谢晋","text":"一院清阴仅亩馀，碧幢高映小禅居。\n疏花暗堕疑香雪，密叶轻翻讶贝书。\n雨滴秋声寒砌近，月分凉影夜窗虚。\n枝间栖凤休惊起，正是山僧入定初。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6758,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题恂上人听潮轩","author":"谢晋","text":"轩窗遥对海门开，汹汹涛声入座来。\n欹枕每惊奔万骑，凭阑时响骇千雷。\n晨兴禅客心偏静，夜语舟人梦已回。\n几度坐忘闻渐杳，松风吹月上楼台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6759,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得雷峰落照送僧游杭","author":"谢晋","text":"连山一抹映霞红，妆点西湖晚景浓。\n长送钓船归远浦，还催僧寺起疏钟。\n浮图插汉光相射，高树悬崖影渐舂。\n欲借鲁戈挥暂驻，照师飞锡过前峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6760,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄浦山人","author":"谢晋","text":"自脱登山屐，便违泉石期。\n绿封林下藓，紫老涧阿芝。\n猿鹤秋应怨，烟霞暮亦思。\n西风丛桂发，要拟是归时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6761,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中王明府招饮是夕就宿期陈士初不至","author":"谢晋","text":"雨歇杏园暝，纷纷客散时。\n主能延共宿，君独负幽期。\n漫剪西窗烛，空烹南涧葵。\n鸟啼残酒醒，达曙罢相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6762,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赋得灵岩怀古送瑀上人","author":"谢晋","text":"吴宫成梵刹，销歇尚遗名。\n台峙荒琴荐，池存涸研泓。\n绮罗无复见，泉石有馀清。\n相送师归去，重增吊古情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6763,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陌上逢琵琶女","author":"谢晋","text":"朝抱琵琶出，暮抱琵琶还。\n琵琶声不改，人自老容颜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6764,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送天界寺僧归苔溪","author":"谢晋","text":"玉磬山前看驻锡，龙河寺里罢闻钟。\n苔花开遍溪南雨，归去何时便得逢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6765,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七宝泉","author":"谢晋","text":"邓尉山中七宝泉，味如沆瀣色如天。\n半泓清浅无穷脉，一线长流不记年。\n刳竹引归香积内，试茶烹近白云边。\n我来酒渴仍秋热，嗽尽馀酣就石眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6766,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画","author":"谢晋","text":"黄鹤矶头望秋色，霜醉寒枫照人赤。\n西风吹雁落衡湘，天影波光共涵碧。\n空林有客来何处，狼籍壶觞各沉醉。\n酒船横放荻花中，坐对青山不归去。\n年来我亦厌黄尘，欲向沧州寄此身。\n终当谢却尘间事，同作沙鸥社里人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6767,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔父词","author":"谢晋","text":"水是侬乡舟是家，白蘋风外钓丝斜。\n樵青自作沧浪调，惊起双凫出浪花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6768,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日雨中白门写怀","author":"谢晋","text":"秋雨长安陌，经朝只闭门。\n阴云连白昼，灯火易黄昏。\n屋漏频移席，囊空久弃樽。\n故乡禾黍熟，何日到江村。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6769,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与盛医紊自吴同舟次孟子河洋口四首 其一","author":"谢晋","text":"风逆舟难进，潮生日又斜。\n已知江口近，岸上有人家。\n客路行将半，乡关望渐赊。\n如何一年里，两度入京华。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6770,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与盛医紊自吴同舟次孟子河洋口四首 其二","author":"谢晋","text":"江上寒惊早，秋深未授衣。\n停桡先问酒，登岸试敲扉。\n鸟下烟汀尽，帆投莫岛稀。\n榜歌声渐杳，浦树远沈晖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6771,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与盛医紊自吴同舟次孟子河洋口四首 其三","author":"谢晋","text":"空江烟雾里，渺渺望中赊。\n雪拥潮头白，风飘雨脚斜。\n乱蛩鸣岸草，一雁宿汀沙。\n梦里闻歌处，篷窗近酒家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6772,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"与盛医紊自吴同舟次孟子河洋口四首 其四","author":"谢晋","text":"万顷苍茫际，风帆瞬息间。\n赋诗同俊逸，把酒对江山。\n白鹭明秋鬓，丹枫照醉颜。\n宦情兼旅况，徒羡钓舟閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":6773,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]